        "liquid": "{% comment %}\n  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n  ║  CTA ACCUEIL — 3 images cliquables                      ║\n  ║  Version : Liquid Personnalisé (sans schema)            ║\n  ║  ► Modifiez URLs + images dans le bloc CONFIG           ║\n  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% assign cta_titre      = \"Vous ne savez pas quelle alarme choisir ?\" %}\n{% assign cta_sous_titre = \"Choisissez votre chemin, on vous guide.\" %}\n\n{% assign quiz_url       = \"https://daewoo-security.fr/pages/configurateur_2\" %}\n{% assign quiz_img       = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/files/Image_Acceuil_Configurateur_Daewoo.png?v=1786099030\" %}\n\n{% assign pack_url       = \"https://daewoo-security.fr/pages/pack-alarmes?_pos=1&_psq=pack&_ss=e&_v=1.0\" %}\n{% assign pack_img       = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/files/Image_Acceuil_Pack_Pret_a_poser_Daewoo.png?v=1786099030\" %}\n\n{% assign compare_url    = \"https://daewoo-security.fr/pages/comparateur-am301-sa501-pa501z\" %}\n{% assign compare_img    = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/files/Image_Acceuil_Comparatif_Daewoo.png?v=1786099030\" %}\n\n<div id=\"ctaacc2-home\">\n\n  <div class=\"c2-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"c2-titre\">{{ cta_titre }}</h2>\n    <p class=\"c2-sous\">{{ cta_sous_titre }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"c2-grille\">\n\n    <!-- CARTE 1 : CONFIGURATEUR -->\n    <a href=\"{{ quiz_url }}\" class=\"c2-carte\" data-i=\"0\">\n      <img src=\"{{ quiz_img }}\" alt=\"Configurateur Daewoo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </a>\n\n    <!-- CARTE 2 : PACK -->\n    <a href=\"{{ pack_url }}\" class=\"c2-carte\" data-i=\"1\">\n      <img src=\"{{ pack_img }}\" alt=\"Packs prêts à poser Daewoo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </a>\n\n    <!-- CARTE 3 : COMPARER -->\n    <a href=\"{{ compare_url }}\" class=\"c2-carte\" data-i=\"2\">\n      <img src=\"{{ compare_img }}\" alt=\"Comparatif des gammes Daewoo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#ctaacc2-home {\n  --c2-bg:      var(--color-background, #f8f9fc);\n  --c2-fg:      var(--color-foreground, #0d1b3e);\n  --c2-hfam:    var(--font-heading-family, system-ui, sans-serif);\n  --c2-bfam:    var(--font-body-family, system-ui, sans-serif);\n  --c2-ease:    cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  --c2-radius:  18px;\n}\n\n#ctaacc2-home {\n  background: var(--c2-bg);\n  padding: 64px 32px 72px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.c2-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n}\n.c2-titre {\n  font-family: var(--c2-hfam);\n  font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--c2-fg);\n  margin: 0 0 .5rem;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(12px);\n  animation: c2-in .55s var(--c2-ease) .08s forwards;\n}\n.c2-sous {\n  font-family: var(--c2-bfam);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--c2-fg);\n  opacity: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  transform: translateY(8px);\n  animation: c2-in .5s var(--c2-ease) .18s forwards;\n}\n\n.c2-grille {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* ── Carte = image cliquable pleine surface ── */\n.c2-carte {\n  display: block;\n  border-radius: var(--c2-radius);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  line-height: 0;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(22px);\n  transition: transform .36s var(--c2-ease), box-shadow .36s var(--c2-ease);\n}\n.c2-carte[data-i=\"0\"] { animation: c2-in .6s var(--c2-ease) .26s forwards; }\n.c2-carte[data-i=\"1\"] { animation: c2-in .6s var(--c2-ease) .38s forwards; }\n.c2-carte[data-i=\"2\"] { animation: c2-in .6s var(--c2-ease) .50s forwards; }\n\n.c2-carte img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.c2-carte:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n  box-shadow: 0 16px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.10);\n}\n.c2-carte:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--c2-fg);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n@keyframes c2-in {\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .c2-grille { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }\n  .c2-carte[data-i=\"2\"] { grid-column: 1/-1; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 540px) {\n  #ctaacc2-home { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }\n  .c2-grille { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .c2-carte[data-i=\"2\"] { grid-column: auto; }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .c2-carte, .c2-titre, .c2-sous { animation: none; opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n}\n</style>",
